  "macroRenderedOutput": {},
  "body": {
    "storage": {
      "value": "<ac:layout><ac:layout-section ac:type=\"two_right_sidebar\" ac:breakout-mode=\"full-width\"><ac:layout-cell><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"info\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"7d0932a8-b058-495b-89c7-b53d963044b5\"><ac:rich-text-body><p>The following guide helps you in installing Bahmni using&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.docker.com/whatisdocker/\">Docker</a>.&nbsp;Docker is an open platform for developers and system admins to build, ship, and run distributed applications. Following instructions are mainly targeted for Mac OS X and Linux users. But they should work with any operating system that supports Docker. You will need to first install docker (and docker-compose). If you are new to Docker, then we encourage you to watch this 15-min introduction to Docker: <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rOTqprHv1YE\" data-card-appearance=\"inline\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rOTqprHv1YE</a> </p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p /><p>To get started with Bahmni on Docker, please see: <ac:link><ri:page ri:content-title=\"Getting Started Quickly with Bahmni on Docker\" ri:version-at-save=\"36\" /><ac:link-body>Getting Started Quickly with Bahmni on Docker</ac:link-body></ac:link>.</p><p /><ac:adf-extension><ac:adf-node type=\"panel\"><ac:adf-attribute key=\"panel-type\">note</ac:adf-attribute><ac:adf-content><p>To start with Bahmni Lite on Docker, please refer <a href=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/3117744129/Getting+Started+Quickly+with+Bahmni+on+Docker#Running-Bahmni-Lite\">this</a>.</p></ac:adf-content></ac:adf-node><ac:adf-fallback><div class=\"panel conf-macro output-block\" style=\"background-color: rgb(234,230,255);border-color: rgb(153,141,217);border-width: 1.0px;\"><div class=\"panelContent\" style=\"background-color: rgb(234,230,255);\">\n<p>To start with Bahmni Lite on Docker, please refer <a href=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/3117744129/Getting+Started+Quickly+with+Bahmni+on+Docker#Running-Bahmni-Lite\" rel=\"nofollow\">this</a>.</p>\n</div></div></ac:adf-fallback></ac:adf-extension><p /><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"info\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"862bd0b5-4f5f-4222-ad2d-8f99d5e3b244\"><ac:rich-text-body><p>To start with Bahmni Standard on Docker, please refer <a href=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/3117744129/Getting+Started+Quickly+with+Bahmni+on+Docker#Running-Bahmni-Standard\">this</a>.</p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro></ac:layout-cell><ac:layout-cell><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"info\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"8049f987-c0c9-4acf-845d-20d79700b62e\"><ac:rich-text-body><p>Bahmni On Docker</p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"children\" ac:schema-version=\"2\" data-layout=\"default\" ac:local-id=\"32a64e89-f04e-46bb-952f-257c831199b4\" ac:macro-id=\"22a62791720475fbb95c1cf02b3ee6e0\" /><p /><ac:image ac:align=\"center\" ac:layout=\"center\" ac:original-height=\"309\" ac:original-width=\"1202\" ac:width=\"557\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"image-20221209-090518.png\" ri:version-at-save=\"1\" /></ac:image></ac:layout-cell></ac:layout-section><ac:layout-section ac:type=\"fixed-width\" ac:breakout-mode=\"default\"><ac:layout-cell><p> </p><p /></ac:layout-cell></ac:layout-section></ac:layout>",
      "representation": "storage",
