    "view": {
      "value": "<div class=\"contentLayout2\">\n<div class=\"columnLayout two-right-sidebar\" data-layout=\"two-right-sidebar\">\n<div class=\"cell normal\" data-type=\"normal\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-information conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"7d0932a8-b058-495b-89c7-b53d963044b5\" data-macro-name=\"info\"><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-info confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p>The following guide helps you in installing Bahmni using <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.docker.com/whatisdocker/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Docker</a>. Docker is an open platform for developers and system admins to build, ship, and run distributed applications. Following instructions are mainly targeted for Mac OS X and Linux users. But they should work with any operating system that supports Docker. You will need to first install docker (and docker-compose). If you are new to Docker, then we encourage you to watch this 15-min introduction to Docker: <a class=\"external-link\" data-card-appearance=\"inline\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rOTqprHv1YE\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rOTqprHv1YE</a> </p></div></div><p /><p>To get started with Bahmni on Docker, please see: <a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/3117744129/Getting+Started+Quickly+with+Bahmni+on+Docker\" data-linked-resource-id=\"3117744129\" data-linked-resource-version=\"49\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Getting Started Quickly with Bahmni on Docker</a>.</p><p /><div class=\"panel conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"\" data-macro-name=\"panel\" style=\"background-color: #EAE6FF;border-color: #998DD9;border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"panelContent\" style=\"background-color: #EAE6FF;\">\n<p>To start with Bahmni Lite on Docker, please refer <a href=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/3117744129/Getting+Started+Quickly+with+Bahmni+on+Docker#Running-Bahmni-Lite\" rel=\"nofollow\">this</a>.</p>\n</div></div><p /><div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-information conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"862bd0b5-4f5f-4222-ad2d-8f99d5e3b244\" data-macro-name=\"info\"><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-info confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p>To start with Bahmni Standard on Docker, please refer <a href=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/3117744129/Getting+Started+Quickly+with+Bahmni+on+Docker#Running-Bahmni-Standard\" rel=\"nofollow\">this</a>.</p></div></div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cell aside\" data-type=\"aside\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-information conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"8049f987-c0c9-4acf-845d-20d79700b62e\" data-macro-name=\"info\"><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-info confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p>Bahmni On Docker</p></div></div><ul class=\"childpages-macro conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"false\" data-layout=\"default\" data-local-id=\"32a64e89-f04e-46bb-952f-257c831199b4\" data-macro-id=\"22a62791720475fbb95c1cf02b3ee6e0\" data-macro-name=\"children\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/3117744129/Getting+Started+Quickly+with+Bahmni+on+Docker\" data-linked-resource-id=\"3117744129\" data-linked-resource-version=\"49\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Getting Started Quickly with Bahmni on Docker</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/3123249153/Running+Bahmni+Lite+with+fresh+database+or+with+CIEL+data+docker\" data-linked-resource-id=\"3123249153\" data-linked-resource-version=\"16\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Running Bahmni Lite with fresh database or with CIEL data (docker)</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/3117219857/Docker+Compose+Profiles\" data-linked-resource-id=\"3117219857\" data-linked-resource-version=\"11\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Docker Compose Profiles</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/3117449270/Using+Implementation+specific+Configuration+docker\" data-linked-resource-id=\"3117449270\" data-linked-resource-version=\"12\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Using Implementation specific Configuration (docker)</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/3117187073/OpenMRS+Configurations+docker\" data-linked-resource-id=\"3117187073\" data-linked-resource-version=\"12\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">OpenMRS Configurations (docker)</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/3117449349/Bahmni-Web+Configurations+docker\" data-linked-resource-id=\"3117449349\" data-linked-resource-version=\"3\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Bahmni-Web Configurations (docker)</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/3117646002/Reports+Configurations+docker\" data-linked-resource-id=\"3117646002\" data-linked-resource-version=\"2\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Reports Configurations (docker)</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/3117514903/OpenELIS+Configurations+docker\" data-linked-resource-id=\"3117514903\" data-linked-resource-version=\"3\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">OpenELIS Configurations (docker)</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/3117482082/Odoo+Configurations+docker\" data-linked-resource-id=\"3117482082\" data-linked-resource-version=\"10\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Odoo Configurations (docker)</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/3113091089/Crater+with+Bahmni+Lite+docker\" data-linked-resource-id=\"3113091089\" data-linked-resource-version=\"6\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Crater with Bahmni Lite (docker)</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/3117613179/PACS+Configurations+docker\" data-linked-resource-id=\"3117613179\" data-linked-resource-version=\"8\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">PACS Configurations (docker)</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/3117514967/Implementer+Interface+Configurations+docker\" data-linked-resource-id=\"3117514967\" data-linked-resource-version=\"3\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Implementer Interface Configurations (docker)</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/3117482143/Metabase+Configuration+docker\" data-linked-resource-id=\"3117482143\" data-linked-resource-version=\"8\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Metabase Configuration (docker)</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/3125870734/Bahmni-Mart+Configuration+docker\" data-linked-resource-id=\"3125870734\" data-linked-resource-version=\"6\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Bahmni-Mart Configuration (docker)</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/3117613272/Appointments+Configuration+docker\" data-linked-resource-id=\"3117613272\" data-linked-resource-version=\"2\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Appointments Configuration (docker)</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/3168010241/SMS+Service+Configuration+docker\" data-linked-resource-id=\"3168010241\" data-linked-resource-version=\"2\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">SMS Service Configuration (docker)</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/3217522692/Configuring+SSL+HTTPs+certificate+docker\" data-linked-resource-id=\"3217522692\" data-linked-resource-version=\"3\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Configuring SSL/HTTPs certificate (docker)</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/3169517585/Upgrading+Bahmni+on+CentOS+to+Bahmni+Standard+or+Lite+on+Docker\" data-linked-resource-id=\"3169517585\" data-linked-resource-version=\"16\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Upgrading Bahmni on CentOS to Bahmni Standard (or Lite) on Docker</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/3117613282/Running+with+Poor+or+No+Internet+Connectivity+docker\" data-linked-resource-id=\"3117613282\" data-linked-resource-version=\"6\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Running with Poor or No Internet Connectivity (docker)</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/3222601729/Performing+a+Backup+Restore+of+Container+Data+Files+docker\" data-linked-resource-id=\"3222601729\" data-linked-resource-version=\"6\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Performing a Backup / Restore of Container Data &amp; Files (docker)</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/3131801637/Running+Bahmni+Lite+with+DB+backup+from+cloud+Docker\" data-linked-resource-id=\"3131801637\" data-linked-resource-version=\"6\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Running Bahmni Lite with DB backup from cloud (Docker)</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/3225583617/Running+Bahmni+Docker+using+Colima\" data-linked-resource-id=\"3225583617\" data-linked-resource-version=\"14\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Running Bahmni Docker using Colima</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/3119710209/Common+Troubleshooting+Guide+docker\" data-linked-resource-id=\"3119710209\" data-linked-resource-version=\"25\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Common Troubleshooting Guide (docker)</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/3195142161/Docker+Timezone+Configuration\" data-linked-resource-id=\"3195142161\" data-linked-resource-version=\"2\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Docker Timezone Configuration</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/3739189264/SMTP+Configuration+for+sending+emails+docker\" data-linked-resource-id=\"3739189264\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">SMTP Configuration for sending emails (docker)</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/embed/4046225429\" data-linked-resource-id=\"4046225429\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"embed\">Untitled Smart Link (3)</a></li></ul><p /><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image image-center\" width=\"557\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/299630726/image-20221209-090518.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1670576721538&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=557&amp;height=143\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/299630726/image-20221209-090518.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1670576721538&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-height=\"309\" data-width=\"1202\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"3117449443\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"image-20221209-090518.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"299630726\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"48\" data-media-id=\"a27334db-45b1-46f7-9e42-7e5f52b8c941\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/299630726/image-20221209-090518.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1670576721538&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1114&amp;height=286 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/299630726/image-20221209-090518.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1670576721538&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=557&amp;height=143 1x\"></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"columnLayout fixed-width\" data-layout=\"fixed-width\">\n<div class=\"cell normal\" data-type=\"normal\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<p> </p><p /></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
